	(text "±12 V enter through a 2×5 shrouded header (the bus +5 V is not used). Each rail: series Schottky, ferrite,\n10 µF + 100 nF. +5VD comes from a forced-PWM buck (no light-load pulse skipping in the audio band);\n+5VA from a linear regulator on its own; each 3.3 V rail from its own LDO. A 0 Ω link after every\nregulator lets a faulty rail be isolated and its current measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "24d86e09-1596-59f8-af7f-e53d55378035")
	)
